{
    "comment": "상품 문의 답변 창 — 판매자 권한이 있는 사람만 연다. 새 답변과 기존 답변 수정이 같은 창을 쓰고,\n     들고 있는 답변 id 유무로 갈린다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "상품 1:1 문의 답변 작성/수정 모달",
        "editor_label": "$t:user.modal_label.shop_detail.qna_reply_modal"
    },
    "id": "qna_reply_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "{{_global.qnaReplyEditId ? $t('shop.qna.reply_edit_title') : $t('shop.qna.reply_write_title')}}",
        "size": "md",
        "closeOnBackdropClick": false
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "comment": "답변 내용 입력",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "space-y-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "space-y-1"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:shop.qna.reply_content"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Textarea",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "답변 본문. 문의 작성 창과 같은 이유로 값이 `_global` 에 산다(모달은 부모 `_local` 을 못 읽는다)",
                                    "event": "onChange",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "qnaReplyForm": {
                                            "content": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "className": "{{(_global.qnaErrors?.content) ? 'w-full px-3 py-2 border border-red-500 dark:border-red-400 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 resize-none' : 'w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 resize-none'}}",
                                "placeholder": "$t:shop.qna.reply_content_placeholder",
                                "rows": 5,
                                "value": "{{_global.qnaReplyForm.content ?? ''}}",
                                "disabled": "{{_global.qnaSubmitting}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{_global.qnaErrors?.content}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 text-xs mt-1 block"
                            },
                            "text": "{{(_global.qnaErrors?.content ?? [])[0] ?? ''}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "comment": "모달 푸터 - 취소 / 등록",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 mt-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "취소 — 진행 표시와 오류를 걷어 낸 뒤 닫는다",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "qnaSubmitting": false,
                                        "qnaErrors": null
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "closeModal"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "flex-1 py-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.qnaSubmitting}}"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "답변 등록/수정 — `qnaReplyEditId` 유무로 갈린다. 먼저 버튼을 잠가 답변이 둘 달리는 것을 막는다",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "qnaSubmitting": true
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "conditions",
                                    "conditions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "수정 모드: PUT /user/inquiries/{id}/reply",
                                            "if": "{{!!_global.qnaReplyEditId}}",
                                            "then": {
                                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/user/inquiries/{{_global.qnaReplyEditId}}/reply",
                                                "auth_required": true,
                                                "params": {
                                                    "method": "PUT",
                                                    "body": {
                                                        "content": "{{_global.qnaReplyForm.content ?? ''}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "onSuccess": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "qnaSubmitting": false,
                                                            "qnaErrors": null,
                                                            "qnaReplyEditId": null
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "closeModal"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "dataSourceId": "qna"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "type": "success",
                                                            "message": "$t:shop.qna.reply_updated"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                                "onError": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "qnaSubmitting": false,
                                                            "qnaErrors": "{{error.errors ?? null}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "type": "error",
                                                            "message": "{{error.message ?? $t('shop.qna.reply_update_failed')}}"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "등록 모드: POST /user/inquiries/{id}/reply",
                                            "then": {
                                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/user/inquiries/{{_global.qnaReplyTargetId}}/reply",
                                                "auth_required": true,
                                                "params": {
                                                    "method": "POST",
                                                    "body": {
                                                        "content": "{{_global.qnaReplyForm.content ?? ''}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "onSuccess": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "qnaSubmitting": false,
                                                            "qnaErrors": null,
                                                            "qnaReplyTargetId": null
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "closeModal"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "dataSourceId": "qna"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "type": "success",
                                                            "message": "$t:shop.qna.reply_submitted"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                                "onError": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "qnaSubmitting": false,
                                                            "qnaErrors": "{{error.errors ?? null}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "type": "error",
                                                            "message": "{{error.message ?? $t('shop.qna.reply_submit_failed')}}"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "flex-1 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.qnaSubmitting}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "if": "{{_global.qnaSubmitting}}",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "spinner",
                                "className": "text-sm animate-spin"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "{{_global.qnaReplyEditId ? $t('shop.qna.save') : $t('shop.qna.reply_submit')}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
